{"final":{"answer":"The reserve for product warranties increased by $6 million from 2005 to 2006 ($4 million at Dec. 31, 2005 to $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006).","value":6,"unit":"USD_million","sources":["source:q11n3","source:q11n4"],"result_id":"tool:1","explanation":"Reserve for product warranties: $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005, per the product warranties note. Change = 10 - 4 = 6 (USD million)."}}